.DS_Store

# Written per-restaurant at runtime
recurring_events.json
data/venue_geocode_cache.json

# NOTE: data/walk_forward_accuracy.json is deliberately NOT ignored. The page
# reads it at runtime to quote an honest error figure; without it a deployment
# silently falls back to the optimistic in-process hold-out number.
